  era: "Section 29 \xB7 Integration of Princely States \xB7 1947 \u2013 1949"
  title: Junagadh
  text: The Nawab of Junagadh acceded to Pakistan, though most of his people were Hindu and the state was surrounded by India. After popular protest and Indian action, a plebiscite in February 1948 favoured India.
